From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 00:10:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3263/3799] soh: rename D_808E4DC4 -> sLimb6Offset

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the offset limb 6 records its transformed position from
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon/z_boss_ganon.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon/z_boss_ganon.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon/z_boss_ganon.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon/z_boss_ganon.c
index 4983d3ce5..1bfe71f76 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon/z_boss_ganon.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon/z_boss_ganon.c
@@ -3330,7 +3330,7 @@ void BossGanon_PostLimbDraw(PlayState* play, s32 limbIndex, Gfx** dList, Vec3s*
     static Vec3f sLeftHandBaseOffset = { -500.0f, 200.0f, -300.0f };  // was D_808E4DA0 [LLM:HIGH]
     static Vec3f sRightHandBaseOffset = { -500.0f, 200.0f, 300.0f };  // was D_808E4DAC [LLM:HIGH]
     static Vec3f sLimbOrigin = { 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f };  // was D_808E4DB8 [LLM:HIGH]
-    static Vec3f D_808E4DC4 = { 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f };
+    static Vec3f sLimb6Offset = { 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f };  // was D_808E4DC4 [LLM:HIGH]
     static Vec3f D_808E4DD0 = { 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f };
     static Vec3f D_808E4DDC = { 1300.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f };
     static Vec3f D_808E4DE8 = { 600.0f, 420.0f, 100.0f };
@@ -3355,7 +3355,7 @@ void BossGanon_PostLimbDraw(PlayState* play, s32 limbIndex, Gfx** dList, Vec3s*
 
         CLOSE_DISPS(play->state.gfxCtx);
     } else if (limbIndex == 6) {
-        Matrix_MultVec3f(&D_808E4DC4, &this->unk_238);
+        Matrix_MultVec3f(&sLimb6Offset, &this->unk_238);  // was D_808E4DC4 [LLM:HIGH]
     } else if (limbIndex == 10) {
         Matrix_MultVec3f(&D_808E4DD0, &this->unk_22C);
 
